        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions #45A 24 Inch Door Handles</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nStunning design 24\" door pull handle from the First Impressions Classic Collection, combines the traditional beauty of 1-1/2\" diameter Reed handle with large ball finials and fancy mounting brackets. Used on both higher end residential and commercial doors.  Great for large entry glass doors or heavy solid wood doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis decorative  door handle is assembled in the USA by the expert craftsmen at First Impressions International, famous for high quality innovational door pull designs. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions #45A Large Reed Front Door Handle\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"made in the USA\">\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Reed Style Brass Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This decorative door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—  it can be custom designed to fit your specific door application in lengths up to 5 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "24 Inch Door Handle, First Impressions #45A",
                "description": "First Impressions #45A -  Stunning design 24 inch door pull handle from the First Impressions Classic Collection, combines the traditional beauty of 1-1/2 inch diameter Reed handle with large ball finials and fancy mounting brackets. Used on both higher end residential and commercial doors.  Great for large entry glass doors or heavy solid wood doors. ",
